Contact-opening x-resolution comparison and unaccepted x4 extension
Source ab3ef9e; independent finite-cell trace/body variation at fixed q16/q24.
NumPy 2.5.1, SciPy 1.18.0, JAX/JAXlib 0.11.0; no Maxwell solve.
All changes below are per dimensionless gap g; physical normal gap is 490*g nm.
The x1/x2 spaces have 215/431 production unknowns and pass the unchanged
3e-10 quadrature, 3e-9 JVP and 1e-8 cell residual guards. Mean B variation
is fixed by identity mean; small mean G variation does not bound nonzero modes.
The initial x4 attempt has references_complete state only, with no JAX
derivative or production cell residual. Its independent q16/q24 guard fails,
so any x2->x4 increments remain unaccepted observations.
No continuum error, convergence rate or optical derivative is qualified.
