STABILIZED_CONTACT_REGRESSION {"coverage": "Full contact regression including compensated-residual cancellation control", "exit_code": 0, "passed": 5, "seconds": 35.56, "test_file": "tests/test_nvf_affine_contact.py"}
The signed intervals are derivatives per dimensionless g: the reference gap
